    "Both clips inform the reconstruction. The rounded upper-front corners of the side panels are approximated with short faceted curves; shelves are treated as horizontal.",
    "The rear exterior, underside and lower drawer interiors are not directly visible. A simple continuous back panel, recessed lower divider and open-topped lower drawer boxes are inferred.",
    "Bamboo panels are estimated at 5\u201310 mm thickness. The unseen lower drawer boxes have slightly rounded corners for robust hollow collision geometry.",
    "Drawer guides are not visible. Ideal prismatic joints replace unseen sliding interfaces, with approximately 3 mm running clearance and travel limits that retain at least 56 mm of drawer depth inside the cabinet. Relative masses are estimates.",
    "The white handle is approximated as a solid rounded lip grip because its underside and attachment details are unclear. Lower ring pulls retain their openings but are rigidly attached in hanging poses; independent ring motion is not reconstructed.",
